---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/base_layout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <h1 class="text-8xl font-black mb-8">The Story</h1>
  <p>
    It was a perfectly normal day when the <span id="noun1" class="mx-2"
      >___</span
    > suddenly became
    <span id="adjective1" class="ml-2">___</span>.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nobody knew what happened. The senior developer tried to <span
      id="verb1"
      class="mx-2">___</span
    > the <span id="noun2" class="ml-2">___</span>, but it <span
      id="adverb1"
      class="mx-2">___</span
    > produced an even bigger <span id="noun3" class="ml-2">___</span>.
  </p>
  <p>
    The team gathered around the <span id="noun4" class="ml-2">___</span>,
    staring at the <span id="adjective2" class="mx-2">___</span> error message.
  </p>
  <p>
    <q class="mr-2">Just <span id="verb2" class="mx-2">___</span> it,</q> someone
    suggested.
  </p>
  <p>
    The developer <span id="adverb2" class="mx-2">___</span> restarted the <span
      id="noun5"
      class="ml-2">___</span
    >.
  </p>
  <p><em class="mr-2">Nothing</em> happened.</p>
  <p>Then <u class="mx-2">everything</u> happened.</p>
  <p>
    The system began to <span id="verb3" class="mx-2">___</span>
    <span id="adjective3" class="mx-2">___</span>
    <span id="noun6" class="mx-2">___</span> across every server.
  </p>
  <p>
    The developer attempted to <span id="verb4" class="mx-2">___</span> the problem
    <span id="adverb3" class="ml-2">___</span>, but the <span
      id="noun7"
      class="mx-2">___</span
    > had already become <span id="adjective4" class="ml-2">___</span>.
  </p>
  <p>
    At<strong class="ml-2">4:59 PM</strong>, the manager walked in and asked, <q
      class="ml-2">Is everything working?</q
    >
  </p>
  <p>Everyone looked at the developer.</p>
  <p>The developer looked at the <span id="noun8" class="ml-2">___</span>.</p>
  <p>Then they <span id="verb5" class="ml-2">___</span>.</p>
  <p><q>Yes.</q></p>
  <p>The developer committed the fix.</p>
  <p>
    The commit message was:<code>fix: hopefully</code> . . . ?
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  body {
    counter-reset: paragraph-counter;
  }
  h1 {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 100%;
  }
  h1::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 8ch;
    right: 0;
    top: 70%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-500);
  }
  p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex;
  }
  p::before {
    counter-increment: paragraph-counter;
    content: counter(paragraph-counter) " ";
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    align-self: center;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-500);
  }
  q {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-violet-300);
  }
  code {
    margin: 0.05rem 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.25rem;
    font-family: monospace;
    text-box-trim: trim-both;
    color: var(--color-warning);
    background-color: var(--color-neutral);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 5px 1px var(--color-primary);
  }
</style>
